  "description": "Sporty versatility and dynamic support – with this combination, the Machete EVO SX 1 provides a rush of adrenaline on every ride. Fast in everyday use and ready for any kind of ride: with the compact Bosch Performance Line SX drive, this e-gravel bike offers support that is as natural as it is dynamic. Combined with the lightweight carbon frame and components such as the Shimano 12-speed GRX gear system and RockShox Rudy suspension fork, sporty riding fun is guaranteed on all routes. But the Machete EVO SX 1 also has something special to offer when it comes to safety: fully integrated into the Rumble Runway drop bar, the powerful Supernova Starstream Mini front light ensures maximum visibility and visibility in combination with the elegant MonkeyLink Twinlights in the dropouts.",
